31,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I have some information. Mizuki is the werewolf.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"What? That's a blatant lie. Jonathan, are you the Seer?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Rin,,Whoa! Already?! Jonathan found them!,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"That was fast. @Jonathan, are you certain?","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"My, what a dramatic revelation. @Jonathan, I assume you are claiming the Seer's mantle?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
