37,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,This is a classic frame. He's likely the werewolf trying to eliminate me early.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Rin,,But Jonathan seems so nice! Why would he lie?,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
