40,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed. However, a werewolf claiming to be the Seer is a common, if crude, tactic.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I have no reason to lie. I'm simply reporting the truth.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"If we execute me and I'm human, we lose a valuable member. We should be cautious.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Rin,,I believe Jonathan! Let's get the werewolf!,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Mizuki, your defense is logical, but the Seer's direct hit is hard to ignore.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"It is a gamble. But logically, if Jonathan is the Seer, Mizuki must go.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
